.TH tupdf n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tupdf \- inspect PDF structure in pure Tcl.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
package require tclutils::tupdf
.fi
.SH COMMANDS
.nf
::tclutils::tupdf::version pdfFile
::tclutils::tupdf::summary pdfFile
::tclutils::tupdf::metadata pdfFile
::tclutils::tupdf::trailer pdfFile
::tclutils::tupdf::objects pdfFile
::tclutils::tupdf::object pdfFile id
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Scans PDF files for header version, object ids, page markers, trailer text,
Info metadata, and raw uncompressed objects. It is an inspector, not a full PDF parser.
.SH ERRORS
.nf
TCLUTILS TUPDF FORMAT      invalid PDF header or malformed object
TCLUTILS TUPDF NOTFOUND    object not found in clear text
TCLUTILS TUPDF ARG         invalid argument
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
tclutils(n), tuhexdump(n), tuhexedit(n)
